{"id": null, "n": "0384001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0384001", "type": "orig", "text": "「毫」，底本作「豪」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0384002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0384002", "type": "orig", "text": "「美」，疑或為「差」，參見《眾經別錄》伯3747號第53行。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0385001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0385001", "type": "orig", "text": "「嚴」字，甲本作「藏」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0385002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0385002", "type": "orig", "text": "「佛」字，甲本作「如來」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0386001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0386001", "type": "orig", "text": "「一卷第十八」，底本原漏，據上下文體例補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0386002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0386002", "type": "orig", "text": "「說」字，底本原作「品」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0386003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0386003", "type": "orig", "text": "甲本在「菩」字上有「諸」字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0387001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0387001", "type": "orig", "text": "甲本在「隨」字上有「如來」二字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0383a2601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0383a2601", "type": "add", "text": "CBETA 按：「󵕕」，「頓」之異體字。可參考潘重規《敦煌俗字譜》（臺北：石門圖書，1978）第366頁。"}
